    title: "Credit Card Rewards: How to Maximize Points, Miles, and Cash Back",
    description: "Credit card rewards are free money — if you use cards correctly. Here's how to pick the right card, maximize rewards, and avoid the traps that erase them.",
    date: "2026-03-20",
